{"id":"vod_sn_36561","vodId":"36561","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士OOO","name_cn":"假面骑士OOO","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/086ece17cf8bb470bf28b53004d4d0fc.jpg"},"summary":"美术馆仓库内的一副石棺因为意外而打开，被封印了800年的Greeed因此而复活。复活后的Greeed力量并不完全，所以他们以组成身体的硬币制造出“Yummy”。Yummy通过吸食人类欲望而成长，同时体内的硬币也会增加。Greeed以此收集硬币。　　偶然卷入复活事件的无理想、无欲望青年火野映司，因为自身的正义感而与Yummy战斗。而五个Greeed之一的Ankh，因为硬币的不足而导致除右手外都不能变身。Ankh看中了映司单纯的性格，于是把OOO Driver交给映司，让映司变身为假面骑士OOO消灭Yummy，自己从中获得硬币。　　假面骑士OOO的战斗到底会如何？Ankh能否重新获得身体？同时，与Greeed有莫大关系的“鸿上基金会”的目的又是什么？　　带着众多谜团，假面骑士OOO的故事开始了……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":48,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FXPyLa4H1L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ava7jsgz041/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/w52nrtjUmL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hhED8TcCxx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UukP7EuPYx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sqQs4td4VA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mKbjp9CEu51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gHGFJT7YT31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gkc3Y0bt6z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WZn6nPek711/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4rDih7HdHn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iQDLGe062S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7XJbsFM5Qu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https:/